---
import Layout from "../layouts/BlogPost.astro";
---

<!-- heroImage="/blog-placeholder-about.jpg" -->
<Layout
  title="About Me"
  description="Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet"
  pubDate={new Date("August 08 2021")}
>
  <p>
    Hiya, I'm Juan. I'm a jewellery artist, designer and engineer based out of
    London, currently living in Seoul. You can contact me at <span>
      juan<span
        class="inline-block relative before:content-['@'] before:absolute"
        ><span class="inline-block overflow-clip opacity-0 text-[0.7em]"
          >[at]</span
        >castrovaron.com
      </span>
    </span>

    <p>
      In addition to my studio work, I run a jewellery brand called Minilith (<a
        href="http://minilith.co.uk"
        class="underline!">minilith.co.uk</a
      >), making silver jewellery inspired by the built environment. I'm based
      in Somerset House, central London's historic arts center. Minilith is part
      of Makerversity, a community of designers, craftspeople and inventors.
    </p>
    <p>
      In a previous career, I worked as a software engineer at Google between
      2017 and 2023. You can find my old archived website here (beware, it's
      quite outdated).
    </p>

    <hr />

    <p>
      <ul>
        <li>Born 1997</li>
        <li>Colombia</li>
      </ul>
    </p>
    <p>
      <h4 class="tgbe-font text-[1rem]!">Education & Residencies:</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <span class="w-[5.5em] inline-block">2023-2025</span> Under-30 Resident
          @ Somerset House, London
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="w-[5.5em] inline-block">2024-2025</span> K2 Academy of Contemporary
          Jewellery, London
        </li>
      </ul>
    </p>
    <p>
      <h4 class="tgbe-font text-[1rem]!">Awards:</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <span class="w-[5.5em] inline-block">2024</span> Goldsmith's Craft & Design
          Awards - Gold Award
        </li>
      </ul>
    </p>
    <p>
      <h4 class="tgbe-font text-[1rem]!">Group Exhibitions:</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <span class="w-[5.5em] inline-block">2024</span> Sheffield, Goldsmiths
          North 12 - 14 July @ Sheffield's Cutler Hall
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="w-[5.5em] inline-block">2024</span> London Goldsmith's Centre
          12 - 14 July
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="w-[5.5em] inline-block">2024</span> Birmingham Assay Office
          12 - 14
        </li>

        <li>
          <span class="w-[5.5em] inline-block">2024</span> London Goldsmith's Hall
          March
        </li>
      </ul>
    </p>
  </p>
  <div class="h-40"></div>
</Layout>
